1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,155
In this town, never trust your
reflection.

2
00:00:02,155 --> 00:00:04,072
The boy in the puddle smiled at me.

3
00:00:04,072 --> 00:00:05,169
But I wasn't smiling.

4
00:00:05,769 --> 00:00:07,234
Don't look at him, Alex.

5
00:00:07,234 --> 00:00:08,934
That thing wants your place.

6
00:00:09,634 --> 00:00:10,944
Then Mom told me the truth.

7
00:00:10,944 --> 00:00:14,564
Every night at 2:17, the things inside
the houses look out the windows.

8
00:00:14,564 --> 00:00:15,618
And if you look back...

9
00:00:15,618 --> 00:00:16,656
they take your place.

10
00:00:17,256 --> 00:00:19,211
That's why the people outside looked
so scared.

11
00:00:19,211 --> 00:00:20,909
They weren't the monsters.

12
00:00:20,909 --> 00:00:22,310
They were the real families.

13
00:00:22,310 --> 00:00:23,811
Locked out of their own homes.

14
00:00:23,811 --> 00:00:25,662
Mom has been outside for three years.

15
00:00:26,262 --> 00:00:28,362
She said there was only one way back
inside.

16
00:00:28,362 --> 00:00:30,422
Make your reflection look away first.

17
00:00:30,422 --> 00:00:31,809
Before the clock hits 2:18.

18
00:00:32,409 --> 00:00:33,484
So I stared at him.

19
00:00:33,484 --> 00:00:34,369
He stared at me.

20
00:00:34,369 --> 00:00:35,272
Ten seconds.

21
00:00:35,272 --> 00:00:35,889
Twenty.

22
00:00:35,889 --> 00:00:37,282
Then the church bell rang.

23
00:00:38,282 --> 00:00:39,047
He blinked.

24
00:00:40,247 --> 00:00:41,327
The puddle went dark.

25
00:00:41,327 --> 00:00:43,485
And every window on the street went
black.

26
00:00:44,185 --> 00:00:46,195
When I opened my eyes, I was in my
room.

27
00:00:46,195 --> 00:00:48,121
And my real mom was holding my hand.

28
00:00:48,721 --> 00:00:51,137
That morning, the people outside
finally went home.

29
00:00:52,037 --> 00:00:53,827
So now, this town has a new rule.

30
00:00:53,827 --> 00:00:54,532
At 2:17 AM...

31
00:00:54,532 --> 00:00:57,083
if something looks at you through the
window...

32
00:00:57,083 --> 00:00:57,951
don't look away.

